+ * FUNCTION: PKIX_CertSelector_MatchCallback
+ * DESCRIPTION:
+ *
+ *  This callback function determines whether the specified Cert pointed to by
+ *  "cert" matches the criteria of the CertSelector pointed to by "selector".
