+/*
+ * FUNCTION: PKIX_CertStore_CRLCallback
+ * DESCRIPTION:
+ *
+ *  This callback function retrieves from the CertStore pointed to by "store"
+ *  all the CRLs that match the CRLSelector pointed to by "selector". It
